   154	Write the unique multiple fibre as `mF`, `m>=2`.  Since every reduced ruling
   155	fibre is one `A1`, Miyanishi Lemma 1.4.3 gives
   156	
   157	```text
   158	Pic(U)=Z/mZ<[F]>,                                      (4.1)
   159	H_i(U;Q)=0 for every i>0.
