   226	arbitrary survivor => type coverage OPEN,
   227	```
   228	
   229	but not replace the second line by the first.
   230	
   231	## 5. Why the Zariski-Main/Hartogs shortcut fails
   232	
   233	Strong Zariski Main factors `g1` as
   234	
   235	```text
   236	A2 open--> Xbar finite--> U,
   237	```
