Miyanishi confirms the general results used for Picard torsion and rational acyclicity under the affine-base/irreducible-fibre hypotheses, and separately confirms that `(d,n,r)` is an added type condition. I’m now checking Orevkov’s theorem statement and proof boundary, because the no-multiple-fibre branch depends on exactly that scope.
